==English==

===Verb===
{{infl|en|verb|head=[[take]] [[after]]}}

# {{idiom}} To [[resemble]] (a parent or ancestor) in [[appearance]] or [[habit]].
#: ''She '''takes after''' her grandmother with her wide eyes and quiet disposition.''
# to [[follow]] someone's [[example]]

